# held/props/flute: the transverse flute for the Flute posture: a pale wooden tube with dark finger holes and brass ends (PROPS, P2b). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. At the mouth (pose arms: mouth), anchored on
# the right shoulder; before the face on the beard layer facing down, behind the far hand facing left, hidden from behind.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held flute
anchor shoulderR
keys held
z 40

view D key mouth origin 2 4 layer beard
